            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CO.1.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Cor 1.3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Blessed be the God and Father of our Lord Jesus Christ, who has blessed us in Christ with every spiritual blessing in the heavenly places, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "even as he chose us in him before the foundation of the world, that we should be holy and blameless before him. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He destined us in love",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1.5",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Or",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "before him in love, having destined us",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " to be his sons through Jesus Christ, according to the purpose of his will, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "COL.1.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Col 1.13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " to the praise of his glorious grace which he freely bestowed on us in the Beloved. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "COL.1.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Col 1.14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " In him we have redemption through his blood, the forgiveness of our trespasses, according to the riches of his grace ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "which he lavished upon us. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For he has made known to us in all wisdom and insight the mystery of his will, according to his purpose which he set forth in Christ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GAL.4.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Gal 4.4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " as a plan for the fulness of time, to unite all things in him, things in heaven and things on earth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
